-- Lab 6 - NRQL Predictions (predictive AI). Paste into the Query builder and run.
-- PREDICT extends the chart with a forecast and a confidence band (Holt-Winters). Needs history:
-- a few hours of loadgen traffic (3-4 h is enough for 5-minute buckets). Fresh accounts have nothing to predict.
-- Billing: PREDICT queries consume Core CCUs (not Advanced Compute). Verified on 2026-11-07.
SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction
WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce'
TIMESERIES 5 minutes SINCE 6 hours ago
PREDICT

-- Variant: predict further out from a longer training window (predict 2 h ahead using 12 h of history).
-- Clause order is PREDICT [holtwinters(...)] [BY <span>] [USING <span>]; USING before BY is a syntax error.
-- SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce' TIMESERIES 5 minutes SINCE 12 hours ago PREDICT BY 2 hours USING 12 hours

-- Cluster was stopped overnight (WSL2 stops the VM when the last shell closes) and the last 6 hours are empty?
-- Point the window at your last continuous block of traffic with absolute times (UTC offset included): PREDICT forecasts
-- from the UNTIL mark, so the dashed part starts there. Find the block with:
--   SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce' SINCE 3 days ago TIMESERIES 2 hours
-- SELECT count(*) FROM Transaction WHERE appName = 'SimplCommerce' SINCE '2026-11-15 21:00:00 +07:00' UNTIL '2026-11-16 07:00:00 +07:00' TIMESERIES 5 minutes PREDICT

-- Capacity trend ("memory full in N days"): SQL Server working set on the kind node, 2 days ahead.
-- History buckets + forecast buckets must stay under 366 (NRDB limit), so widen the bucket when you look further out.
-- (K8sVolumeSample on kind carries no pvcName for mssql-data, so a PVC forecast is empty here.)
-- SELECT average(memoryWorkingSetBytes)/1e6 FROM K8sContainerSample WHERE containerName = 'mssql' TIMESERIES 1 hour SINCE 3 days ago PREDICT BY 2 days
